Subject: [PATCH] Rust::com: Add MethodInArgPtr for Rust method arguments
 (draft)

Addresses #781 (draft, not ready for review).

Add a MethodInArgPtr<T> plumbing type with a LoLa size-check test
support library. ABI layout and ownership semantics are not yet settled
and lint evidence is missing.

Implemented with DeepSeek V4 Flash (Fabro).

